      "seed": 21970673,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 367519,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791446554856,
      "created": 1791446469199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vector<int>dp(n,1)\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++):\n    for(int j = i-1 ; j>=0 ; j--):\n        if(arr[j] < arr[i]) we can extend using this\n            dp[i] = max(dp[i],1 + dp[j]) // +1 to add ith wala as well as",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vector<int>dp(n,1)\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++):\n    for(int j = i-1 ; j>=0 ; j--):\n        if(arr[j] < arr[i]) we can extend using this\n            dp[i] = max(dp[i],1 + dp[j]) // +1 to add ith wala as well as ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
