      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vector<int>candidate(n+1,INT_MAX)\n\ncandidate[0] = INT_MIN\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n; i++) :\n\n    auto it = lower_bound(candidate.begin(),candidate.end(),A[i])\n    \n    *it = A[i] // replace that place with\n\n    \nint ans = 0;\n\nfor(int i = 1 ; i<=n;i++):\n    if(candidate[i]==INF)break;\n    ans++;\n\ncout << ans;\n    ",
